# Repository files that must not be served as part of the site.
#
# assets.directory is the repository root, so anything NOT listed here is
# reachable over HTTP. .well-known/ is deliberately absent from this list —
# it carries security.txt (RFC 9116) and is meant to be public.
README.md
LICENSE
justfile
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.gitignore
.github
